{"key":"strong-components-7bc3fab2bf3f1c5d","sourceHash":"7bc3fab2bf3f1c5ddd73e685f26816bfcc57e2ca57ddf61e59697faf7f7df0f4","pattern":"strong-components","category":"graph-traversal","title":"Challenge: Strongly Connected Components","idea":"Use finish order plus reversed edges, or low links, to collapse mutual reachability.","complexity":"O(V+E) SCC traversal; canonical report sorting adds O(V log V)","source":"fn csv<T: std::fmt::Display>(a: impl IntoIterator<Item = T>) -> String {\n    a.into_iter()\n        .map(|x| x.to_string())\n        .collect::<Vec<_>>()\n        .join(\",\")\n}\nfn semicolon<T: std::fmt::Display>(a: Vec<Vec<T>>) -> String {\n    a.into_iter().map(csv).collect::<Vec<_>>().join(\";\")\n}\nfn strongly_connected(graph: &[Vec<usize>]) -> Vec<Vec<usize>> {\n    fn finish(v: usize, g: &[Vec<usize>], seen: &mut [bool], order: &mut Vec<usize>) {\n        seen[v] = true;\n        for &u in &g[v] {\n            if !seen[u] {\n                finish(u, g, seen, order);\n            }\n        }\n        order.push(v);\n    }\n    fn collect(v: usize, g: &[Vec<usize>], seen: &mut [bool], group: &mut Vec<usize>) {\n        seen[v] = true;\n        group.push(v);\n        for &u in &g[v] {\n            if !seen[u] {\n                collect(u, g, seen, group);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    let n = graph.len();\n    let mut reverse = vec![Vec::new(); n];\n    for (v, ns) in graph.iter().enumerate() {\n        for &u in ns {\n            reverse[u].push(v);\n        }\n    }\n    let mut seen = vec![false; n];\n    let mut order = Vec::new();\n    for v in 0..n {\n        if !seen[v] {\n            finish(v, graph, &mut seen, &mut order);\n        }\n    }\n    seen.fill(false);\n    let mut groups = Vec::new();\n    for v in order.into_iter().rev() {\n        if !seen[v] {\n            let mut group = Vec::new();\n            collect(v, &reverse, &mut seen, &mut group);\n            group.sort_unstable();\n            groups.push(group);\n        }\n    }\n    groups.sort();\n    groups\n}\n\nfn main() {\n    let result = semicolon(strongly_connected(&[vec![1], vec![0, 2], vec![]]));\n    println!(\"{result}\");\n}\n","sites":[{"line":29,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"let n = graph.len();"},{"line":30,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"let mut reverse = vec![Vec::new(); n];"},{"line":31,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"for (v, ns) in graph.iter().enumerate() {"},{"line":32,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"for &u in ns {"},{"line":33,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"reverse[u].push(v);"},{"line":34,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"}"},{"line":36,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"let mut seen = vec![false; n];"},{"line":37,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"let mut order = Vec::new();"},{"line":38,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"for v in 0..n {"},{"line":39,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"if !seen[v] {"},{"line":40,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"finish(v, graph, &mut seen, &mut order);"},{"line":41,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"}"},{"line":43,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"seen.fill(false);"},{"line":44,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"let mut groups = Vec::new();"},{"line":45,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"for v in order.into_iter().rev() {"},{"line":46,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"if !seen[v] {"},{"line":47,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"let mut group = Vec::new();"},{"line":48,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"collect(v, &reverse, &mut seen, &mut group);"},{"line":49,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"group.sort_unstable();"},{"line":50,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"groups.push(group);"},{"line":51,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"}"},{"line":53,"function":"strongly_connected","statement":"groups.sort();"},{"line":54,"function":"strongly_connect